 ("sopater","sosipater","probable","Sosipater is the fuller form of Sopater. Romans was written from Greece just before the journey of Acts 20:4, on which Sopater sets out with Paul."),
 ("jason_thess","jason_rom","possible","Both are associates of Paul in the Aegean mission, and Romans 16:21 places its Jason beside a probable Beroean. The name is common."),
